# Fixed ids for jailed daemons (docs/minijail.md). S92transmission runs its
# daemon as 8422 (pinning package/transmission's user), /usr/bin/bluetoothd as 8423,
# S01syslogd as 8424, S02klogd as 8425, wpa-jail (wpa_supplicant) as 8426, gpm-jail
# (gpm) as 8427 and mister-sinden-lightgun (Sinden's driver) as 8428. 8429 mister owns
# /dev/mister/* (65-mister-uio.rules) for a future non-root Main; nothing runs as it yet.
transmission 8422 transmission 8422 * /var/lib/transmission - transmission Transmission Daemon
bluetooth 8423 bluetooth 8423 * - - - BlueZ Daemon
syslog 8424 syslog 8424 * - - - BusyBox syslogd
klog 8425 klog 8425 * - - - BusyBox klogd
wpa 8426 wpa 8426 * - - - wpa_supplicant
gpm 8427 gpm 8427 * - - - gpm
sinden 8428 sinden 8428 * - - - Sinden Lightgun driver
mister 8429 mister 8429 * - - video MiSTer Main
